msgid "ReliefCapture"
msgstr "ReliefCapture"

msgid ""
"ReliefCapture 是独立的 C++17 / FLTK 截图与标注工具，使用系统中文字体和 FLTK 默认 gtk+ "
"控件，位于桌面应用分组，不属于 ReliefOffice。 窗口内直接显示截图与标注工具栏，程序名仅位于窗口标题栏。"
msgstr ""
"ReliefCapture is a standalone C++17 / FLTK screenshot and annotation tool "
"using system Chinese fonts and FLTK's default gtk+ widgets. It belongs to "
"the desktop applications group, not ReliefOffice. The window directly "
"displays the screenshot and annotation toolbar; the program name appears "
"only in the title bar."

msgid "截图"
msgstr "Taking Screenshots"

msgid ""
"按 **Win+Shift+S** 可直接选择截图。桌面先冻结，顶部显示区域、窗口、全屏和取消按钮。 拖动鼠标选择矩形区域；按 W 后点击普通窗口，按 "
"F 截取整个 X 屏幕，按 R 返回区域模式。 Esc 或鼠标右键取消。选区显示实际像素尺寸。"
msgstr ""
"Press **Win+Shift+S** to start selection directly. The desktop freezes, with"
" Region, Window, Full Screen, and Cancel buttons at the top. Drag to select "
"a rectangular region; press W then click an ordinary window, F to capture "
"the entire X screen, or R to return to region mode. Esc or right-click "
"cancels. The selection shows its actual pixel dimensions."

msgid ""
"截图后打开编辑窗口，并自动将图像复制到 X11 剪贴板。可直接粘贴到支持图像的应用。 剪贴板由本进程提供，**粘贴前请保持 ReliefCapture "
"运行**，退出后不保证继续可用。"
msgstr ""
"After capture, the editor opens and automatically copies the image to the "
"X11 clipboard, ready to paste into image-capable applications. This process "
"supplies the clipboard, so **keep ReliefCapture running until you paste**; "
"availability after exit is not guaranteed."

msgid ""
"普通启动打开编辑窗口。“截图模式”可选择区域、窗口或全屏，“延时”支持无延时及 3、5、10 秒。点击“新建截图”或 Ctrl+N "
"开始。倒计时中可点击“取消”或按 Esc。 调用截图前隐藏自身窗口，完成或取消后恢复编辑器。重复调用快捷键会交给同一用户、 同一 DISPLAY "
"下的已有实例，不叠加多个选区。"
msgstr ""
"Normal launch opens the editor. Capture Mode offers region, window, or full "
"screen; Delay offers none, 3, 5, or 10 seconds. Click New Screenshot or "
"Ctrl+N to start; during countdown, click Cancel or press Esc. The "
"application hides its own window before capture and restores the editor "
"after completion or cancellation. Repeated shortcut invocations are "
"forwarded to the existing instance for the same user and DISPLAY rather than"
" creating overlapping selections."

msgid ""
"窗口截图取冻结桌面上窗口边框所在的矩形，保留实际可见的遮挡；不恢复被其他窗口 盖住的内容。支持截图的范围是当前 X11 根屏幕，不提供各显示器单独选择。"
msgstr ""
"Window capture takes the rectangle bounded by the window frame on the frozen"
" desktop, retaining visible occlusions; it does not recover content covered "
"by other windows. Capture covers the current X11 root screen, without "
"individual-monitor selection."

msgid "标注与保存"
msgstr "Annotation and Saving"

msgid ""
"标注工具提供画笔、箭头、矩形和文字，支持七种颜色、四种线宽与四种字号。 选择工具后在图像上拖动画线或矩形，文字工具点击后输入内容。Ctrl+Z 撤销， "
"Ctrl+Y 或 Ctrl+Shift+Z 重做；新标注会清除已经撤销部分的重做记录。"
msgstr ""
"Annotation tools include a pen, arrow, rectangle, and text, with seven "
"colors, four line widths, and four font sizes. Select a tool and drag on the"
" image to draw lines or rectangles; click with the text tool to enter text. "
"Ctrl+Z undoes; Ctrl+Y or Ctrl+Shift+Z redoes. A new annotation clears the "
"redo history of undone actions."

msgid "“适应窗口”方便查看整张图，“100%”以原始像素显示，可用滚动条浏览。 缩放只影响预览，复制和导出的尺寸保持原始截图像素。"
msgstr ""
"Fit to Window shows the whole image conveniently; 100% displays original "
"pixels with scrollbars for navigation. Zoom affects only the preview; copied"
" and exported dimensions retain the original screenshot pixels."

msgid "Ctrl+C：复制当前图像，包括标注。"
msgstr "Ctrl+C: copy the current image, including annotations."

msgid "Ctrl+S：保存 PNG；未填写 ``.png`` 后缀时自动补上。"
msgstr "Ctrl+S: save as PNG; ``.png`` is appended automatically if omitted."

msgid "Ctrl+N：按当前模式和延时重新截图。"
msgstr "Ctrl+N: capture again using the current mode and delay."

msgid ""
"保存前可以选择位置；替换已有文件需要确认。新文件权限为 0600，保存通过同目录 "
"临时文件和原子发布完成，拒绝符号链接、非普通文件，发布前再次检查目标身份和修改时间。 PNG "
"编码与磁盘写入在后台执行；保存期间关闭窗口会等待本次保存结束。 关闭前会提示保存未保存的截图，重新截图前会提示放弃未保存的标注。"
msgstr ""
"Choose a destination before saving; replacing an existing file requires "
"confirmation. New files use mode 0600. Saving uses a same-directory "
"temporary file and atomic publication, rejects symbolic links and nonregular"
" files, and rechecks target identity and modification time before "
"publication. PNG encoding and disk writing run in the background; closing "
"during saving waits for that save to finish. Before closing, unsaved "
"screenshots prompt for saving; before recapturing, unsaved annotations "
"prompt for discard confirmation."

msgid "IceWM 配置"
msgstr "IceWM Configuration"

msgid "系统默认键位文件为 ``/etc/reliefos/icewm/keys``，经 ``/etc/icewm`` 使用："
msgstr ""
"The default system key binding file is ``/etc/reliefos/icewm/keys``, used "
"through ``/etc/icewm``:"

msgid ""
"新会话会读取这条默认绑定。已有会话需重新登录或重启 IceWM 以重新读取键位。 如果用户自己的 ``~/.icewm/keys`` "
"覆盖了系统文件，应将此行添加到该用户文件。 本程序不会覆盖用户自定义键位。"
msgstr ""
"New sessions read this default binding. Existing sessions need a new login "
"or an IceWM restart to reread keys. If a user's ``~/.icewm/keys`` overrides "
"the system file, add this line there. The program does not overwrite custom "
"user bindings."

msgid "范围与限制"
msgstr "Scope and Limits"

msgid ""
"每边最大 8192 像素，每张最多 16,777,216 像素；最多 512 条标注， 每条画笔最多 8192 点，文字最多 1024 UTF-8 "
"字节。超过限制明确提示。 不含录屏、滚动长截图、OCR、自由形状选区或自动上传。"
msgstr ""
"Each side is limited to 8192 pixels and each image to 16,777,216 pixels. "
"There may be at most 512 annotations, 8192 points per pen stroke, and 1024 "
"UTF-8 bytes per text annotation. Exceeding limits produces an explicit "
"message. Screen recording, scrolling screenshots, OCR, freeform selection, "
"and automatic uploads are not included."
